+// Patched copy of the vanilla 26.3 class (stage-2 terrain, docs/stage2/TERRAIN-PLAN.md S1/S2). Differences from vanilla:
+//  - SectionDraw carries the nullable TerrainMeshInfo of its section-layer (facing buckets, planes, bounds); the
+//    vanilla three-argument constructor is kept (info = null, which disables S1/S2 for that draw).
+//  - SectionDraw.compact (S5): the section-layer's vertices are the 16-byte TerrainCompact format (drawn with the
+//    *_COMPACT pipelines); false for every other draw.
